# Line endings are pinned in transport (D-071).
# core.autocrlf silently falsifies three ratified byte-level claims on checkout:
# D-012's index determinism, D-018/D-028's newline discipline, and D-068's
# structural coupling asserted as byte-equality (D-069).
# Broad by decision — a per-extension pin leaves every future file class as a
# rediscovery. Binary escape hatches wait for the first binary file.
* text eol=lf
